  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Total ways of choosing 2 squares&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>2</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>64</mn></mmultiscripts><mo>=</mo><mn>32</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>63</mn></math></p><p>Now,&nbsp;each corners has two neighbours, and each&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>24</mn></math> &nbsp;squares across the&nbsp;outer edge of the chess board has <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math>&nbsp;neighbours, and remaining <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>36</mn></math>&nbsp;squares have four neighbours</p><p>Favorable&nbsp;ways <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>24</mn><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>36</mn><mo>(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mn>224</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>112</mn><mo>.</mo></math>Since, every pair counted twice.&nbsp;</p><p>Required probability <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>112</mn><mrow><mn>32</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>63</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>18</mn></mfrac></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
